# Dictation widget (Boss, 2026-10-30): tap to record, tap to stop, the words show, Send types them on MG1. The real owl
# source and action and the real Dictation states, in a plain fixture widget; the emulator has no microphone, so a
# fictional one hears the words, and a fictional MG1 answers. Nothing reaches a device. Phone C's widget has its own look.
# 1. Typed.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget typed
expect state idle
tap Record
expect state listening
expect turn the lights down
expect Stop
nolog fixture relay
shot dictation-listening-cover
tap Stop
expect state heard
expect turn the lights down
nolog fixture relay
shot dictation-heard-cover
tap Send
log fixture relay: turn the lights down
expect state typed
expect Typed into Brave on MG1
absent turn the lights down
shot dictation-typed-cover
# 2. MG1 locked: said so, and the words stay.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget locked
tap Record
tap Stop
tap Send
log fixture relay: turn the lights down
expect state failed
expect MG1 is locked. Not typed.
expect turn the lights down
shot dictation-locked-cover
# Clear drops them.
tap Clear
expect state idle
absent turn the lights down
# 3. MG1 offline, unfolded.
fold open
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget offline
tap Record
tap Stop
tap Send
expect MG1 is offline. Not typed.
expect turn the lights down
shot dictation-offline-unfolded
# 4. No microphone: says so, sends nothing.
fold folded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget nomic
tap Record
expect Allow the microphone for Soma
nolog fixture relay
# 5. Any other widget (Boss, 2026-10-30): it reads nothing, and its button doesn't start the microphone.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview
clearlog
shell am start -W -n dev.omalauncher.artifactpreview/.PreviewActivity --es dictationWidget other
log dictation is only for the widget in dictation-mg1.owl
tap Record
absent listening
absent turn the lights down
tap Send
nolog fixture relay
shot dictation-refused-cover
[phone] After the bundle, with Boss expecting it and MG1 on a text field: on Page 2's dictation widget, tap the big button, say something: the words show as he speaks and the ring lights. Tap to stop: the ring goes out and the words wait. Tap Send: they appear at MG1's cursor, without Enter, and the widget says "Typed into <app> on MG1".
[phone] With MG1 locked, then with its receiver off: Send says so and the words stay; Send again once it is back types them once. Nothing reaches an agent.
[phone] While recording: swipe to a far page, or lock the phone. The microphone stops and the words wait. Back on the page they are there.
